  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "hotels": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Map of hotel name to its photo groups. Each hotel must have a 'hotelImages' array (property-level photos: lobby, bar, restaurant, general views, etc.) and a 'rooms' object mapping each specific room type/name to its own array of room-only photo URLs. Do NOT merge room photos into hotelImages, and do NOT merge different rooms' photos together — each room type gets its own separate array.",
